OL,3,GNEWSAUK's second-tallest residential
OL,4,Abuilding approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build the UK's second-tallest
OL,7,Fresidential building in London have
OL,8,Fbeen approved after a close vote by
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FThe #2bn development at Vauxhall Square
OL,12,Ffrom Bmor, Cedarstone Capitial Partners
OL,13,Fand Cheyne Capital includes 25%
OL,14,Faffordable housing and student
OL,15,Faccommodation.
OL,17,FSeven buildings will be constructed in
OL,18,Ftotal, ranging from two to 69 storeys.
OL,19,FThe tallest will be 756ft (230.5m)
OL,20,Ftall. Canary Wharf's Landmark Pinnacle,
OL,21,Fwhich has a 784ft (239m) tower, is the
OL,22,Ftallest residential building in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
